    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1726814842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1726814842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1726814842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>MiceGard is an adventure game where you'll play as mouse-vikings. Immerse yourself in a unique world inspired by Scandinavian mythology.<br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Epic saga of trust, betrayal, bravery and cute little animals.<br></li><li> Short story of furry Norse heroes.<br></li><li> One-evening experience of heroism and mystery!<br></li><li> Capricious Gods and eldritch magic.<br></li><li> Choose wisely for even mouse's choice matters!<br></li><li> Furious battles and cunning tactical challenges.<br></li><li> Protect your village and kin - but watch out for dark conspiracies!<br></li><li> Become the hero people want you to be - even if it is mice-people.<br></li><li> Enjoy art created with love for mice and norse myths.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1726814842\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1726814842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430660/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1726814842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>MiceGard is an adventure game where you'll play as mouse-vikings. Immerse yourself in a unique world inspired by Scandinavian mythology.<br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Epic saga of trust, betrayal, bravery and cute little animals.<br></li><li> Short story of furry Norse heroes.<br></li><li> One-evening experience of heroism and mystery!<br></li><li> Capricious Gods and eldritch magic.<br></li><li> Choose wisely for even mouse's choice matters!<br></li><li> Furious battles and cunning tactical challenges.<br></li><li> Protect your village and kin - but watch out for dark conspiracies!<br></li><li> Become the hero people want you to be - even if it is mice-people.<br></li><li> Enjoy art created with love for mice and norse myths.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play MiceGard, adventure game where viking mice fight for honor, fame and survival. Explore the world inspired by Norse mythology, meet with gods and warlocks and seize the glory of the fiercest mouse-warrior in this action-packed saga!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish",
